[issue.1587]
number = 1587
title = "[Coherence] The blocking reward-request-schema finding claims l18_requests and l18_audit have no production schema, but the reviewed launchpad migration registry declares both for the pnl-tracker"
revision = "bb8caac8b3e73e3e2f4b330805574f0bcb540641"
verdict = "spec-edit"
evidence = "The completed audit task (spec/layerx-merge/spec.kvx:378966) must correct its missing-schema claim and blocking entry (spec/layerx-merge/programme/audit/records/22.30.21.kvx:11,924,935): migration 180001 already defines pnl.l18_requests with a UUID request_key and pnl.l18_audit (launchpad/spec/production-system/integration/migrations/180001.sql:1,2,3,8), its registration identifies core/pnl-tracker and L18 (launchpad/spec/production-system/integration/migrations/registry.json:2040), the coordinator helper reads that registry (sdk/launchpad/shared/db/production/coordinatortest/coordinatortest.go:168), and the proof now invokes the registered migration instead of hand-written reward tables (services/launchpad/pnl-tracker/internal/app/proof_launchpad_pnl_tracker_test.go:85,467,490; commits 0a31ef03e9b302752af4c62397418a06914f011d and 3924248dd2fc42125eb6f7c5b735d475471e379b), while null approval metadata remains a separate admission defect recorded in input/1904.md (launchpad/spec/production-system/integration/migrations/registry.json:2051; services/launchpad/pnl-tracker/internal/migrate/reward.go:38)."
close_comment = "The audit needs to acknowledge that registered migration 180001 already defines both reward persistence tables and that the proof now uses the registered migration path, replacing the false missing-schema blocker with accurate evidence. The approval-binding defect tracked in #1904 remains separate, and the independent emitter/caller finding still prevents upgrade-ready status."
